1
00:01:34,070 --> 00:01:37,820
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>Naruto Shippuden, Sasuke's Story:</i>
<i>Sunrise, Part 2: Coliseum</i>
</b></font>

2
00:01:44,240 --> 00:01:46,950
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>"Encountered Exploding Humans."</b></font>

3
00:01:47,030 --> 00:01:52,280
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>"Will investigate independently.
Please approve."</b></font>

4
00:01:55,740 --> 00:01:59,820
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Just how long will
your journey continue?</b></font>

5
00:02:14,990 --> 00:02:17,450
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Sasuke, where are you going?</b></font>

6
00:02:19,070 --> 00:02:22,030
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>You're Sasuke Uchiha, right?</b></font>

7
00:02:23,200 --> 00:02:27,240
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>The lone survivor of
the exalted Uchiha Clan.</b></font>

8
00:02:28,700 --> 00:02:31,740
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>I knew it the moment I saw
your Sharingan last night.</b></font>

9
00:02:32,570 --> 00:02:34,620
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Where are you going now?</b></font>

10
00:02:35,030 --> 00:02:37,240
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>That has nothing to do with you.</b></font>

11
00:02:37,320 --> 00:02:39,030
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>It does involve us!</b></font>

12
00:02:40,530 --> 00:02:41,950
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Amino…</b></font>

13
00:02:42,030 --> 00:02:44,620
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>…made us yummy meals.</b></font>

14
00:02:47,910 --> 00:02:49,700
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>She was kind.</b></font>

15
00:02:52,070 --> 00:02:54,700
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>You're going to look for
that Fuushin guy, right?</b></font>

16
00:02:58,370 --> 00:03:00,700
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>But isn't he the one who changed
Amino and the others</b></font>

17
00:03:00,780 --> 00:03:03,070
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>into the human something
or other, right?</b></font>

18
00:03:03,990 --> 00:03:05,780
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>We're going with you.</b></font>

19
00:03:05,870 --> 00:03:08,200
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>I think we may be able to help.</b></font>

20
00:03:13,780 --> 00:03:17,320
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>And don't give us that look that says
"I don't need you guys!"</b></font>

21
00:03:17,410 --> 00:03:19,780
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>That will only make us more determined!</b></font>

22
00:03:19,870 --> 00:03:22,200
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Sasuke dear, are you listening?!</b></font>

23
00:03:26,160 --> 00:03:29,660
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>I don't care what you do.
Just stop calling me that.</b></font>

24
00:03:29,820 --> 00:03:33,070
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>I figure I'm older than you,
Sasuke dear.</b></font>

25
00:03:33,160 --> 00:03:36,320
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>So I can call you "dear."</b></font>

26
00:03:36,990 --> 00:03:39,320
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Older? You?</b></font>

27
00:03:39,410 --> 00:03:41,160
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Ahem!</b></font>

28
00:03:48,280 --> 00:03:49,870
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>By that much?</b></font>

29
00:03:49,950 --> 00:03:52,410
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>What do you mean by "that much"?</b></font>

30
00:03:55,200 --> 00:03:59,030
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Sasuke dear, it's not good
to judge people by their looks</b></font>

31
00:03:59,030 --> 00:04:01,370
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>or by your impression of them.</b></font>

32
00:04:03,030 --> 00:04:05,200
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>You shouldn't judge people</i></b></font>

33
00:04:05,280 --> 00:04:07,620
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>by their looks or</i>
<i>by your impression of them.</i></b></font>

34
00:04:07,700 --> 00:04:10,030
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>HIDDEN LEAF POLICE FORCE

<i>Are you going to join too, Big Brother?</i></b></font>

35
00:04:10,030 --> 00:04:12,160
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>HIDDEN LEAF POLICE FORCE

<i>I wonder…</i></b></font>

36
00:04:12,240 --> 00:04:15,120
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>You should! When I'm older…</i></b></font>

37
00:04:15,200 --> 00:04:17,820
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>I'm going to join</i>
<i>the Leaf Police Force too!</i></b></font>

38
00:04:17,950 --> 00:04:19,910
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>Forgive me, Sasuke…</i></b></font>

39
00:04:20,620 --> 00:04:22,240
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>This is the last time.</i></b></font>

40
00:04:23,410 --> 00:04:29,450
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>No matter what happens from now,</i>
<i>I will love you always.</i></b></font>

41
00:04:29,950 --> 00:04:31,320
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Sasuke dear!</b></font>

42
00:04:32,200 --> 00:04:33,870
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Sasuke dear!</b></font>

43
00:04:35,160 --> 00:04:39,660
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>By the way… Have you been back to
the Hidden Leaf Village, Sasuke dear?</b></font>

44
00:04:41,700 --> 00:04:43,990
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>What? Ignoring me again?</b></font>

45
00:04:44,070 --> 00:04:48,660
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>What about reviving the Uchiha Clan?
You're the lone survivor, right?</b></font>

46
00:04:49,160 --> 00:04:52,030
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Hello! Are you there, Sasuke?!</b></font>

47
00:04:52,320 --> 00:04:54,280
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Chino, stop it.</b></font>

48
00:04:55,320 --> 00:04:58,120
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Whose side are you on anyway?
You know, you…</b></font>

49
00:05:04,160 --> 00:05:07,410
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Hey, where are we going?</b></font>

50
00:05:09,200 --> 00:05:10,910
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Ignoring me again!</b></font>

51
00:05:12,200 --> 00:05:14,070
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>I mean…</b></font>

52
00:05:14,160 --> 00:05:15,160
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Hey.</b></font>

53
00:05:15,240 --> 00:05:18,200
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>My name isn't "hey"!</b></font>

54
00:05:19,120 --> 00:05:21,490
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>You asked if I'm going to
look for Fuushin.</b></font>

55
00:05:21,570 --> 00:05:23,030
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>The answer is yes.</b></font>

56
00:05:23,320 --> 00:05:24,570
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Huh?</b></font>

57
00:05:25,530 --> 00:05:29,070
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>That's what I should do right now.</b></font>

58
00:05:29,280 --> 00:05:31,910
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>A-Any ideas on where to look?</b></font>

59
00:05:32,870 --> 00:05:35,530
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>The only thing that can create
an Exploding Human</b></font>

60
00:05:35,620 --> 00:05:37,780
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>is a Kekkei Genkai.</b></font>

61
00:05:39,620 --> 00:05:44,410
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>H-Hey, Sasuke dear…
Hold on a minute…</b></font>

62
00:05:48,990 --> 00:05:53,740
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>You think you'll find him inside
that really scary-looking cave?</b></font>

63
00:05:55,620 --> 00:05:57,990
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Ignoring me again!</b></font>

64
00:06:06,910 --> 00:06:08,990
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>You're Sasuke, right?</b></font>

65
00:06:09,570 --> 00:06:12,370
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>You can call me Yamato.</b></font>

66
00:06:13,120 --> 00:06:18,030
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Since you're watching over this place,
it must mean that Orochimaru is here.</b></font>

67
00:06:18,120 --> 00:06:21,160
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>O-Orochimaru? You mean that—?!</b></font>

68
00:06:21,160 --> 00:06:23,620
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>What's the purpose of your visit?</b></font>

69
00:06:24,120 --> 00:06:29,120
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>I can't allow just anyone through
to see Orochimaru.</b></font>

70
00:06:29,410 --> 00:06:32,530
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Regarding the Exploding Humans
that attacked the Hidden Leaf…</b></font>

71
00:06:32,620 --> 00:06:37,160
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>It's possible Orochimaru may have
information about the perpetrator.</b></font>

72
00:06:40,200 --> 00:06:42,700
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Did you send word about this
to Lord Sixth?</b></font>

73
00:06:43,240 --> 00:06:46,070
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>I intend to, if I get results.</b></font>

74
00:06:47,660 --> 00:06:50,910
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>It would be much easier for us
to coordinate things,</b></font>

75
00:06:50,990 --> 00:06:54,030
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>if you'd send us progress reports…</b></font>

76
00:06:55,030 --> 00:06:56,120
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>However…</b></font>

77
00:06:57,320 --> 00:07:00,820
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>You're doing this all for the sake
for the Hidden Leaf, right?</b></font>

78
00:07:05,820 --> 00:07:07,030
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Yeah…</b></font>

79
00:07:09,410 --> 00:07:11,370
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Then there's nothing else to say.</b></font>

80
00:07:12,030 --> 00:07:15,070
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>I'll send Lord Sixth a report.</b></font>

81
00:07:15,570 --> 00:07:17,660
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Remember, we're comrades.</b></font>

82
00:07:17,740 --> 00:07:23,070
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>I'm sure Mr. Kakashi also taught you
the importance of trust and teamwork.</b></font>

83
00:07:24,820 --> 00:07:26,120
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Thank you…</b></font>

84
00:07:38,570 --> 00:07:42,160
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>It's been a long time, Sasuke.</b></font>

85
00:07:42,200 --> 00:07:45,490
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>You've brought some
interesting-looking friends with you.</b></font>

86
00:07:47,120 --> 00:07:50,320
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Do you know Fuushin
of the Lightning Gang?</b></font>

87
00:07:50,910 --> 00:07:55,780
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>What? Not even a greeting?
You're as blunt as ever.</b></font>

88
00:07:56,070 --> 00:07:58,950
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Tell me everything you know.</b></font>

89
00:07:59,490 --> 00:08:03,030
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Is that any way to ask
a person something?</b></font>

90
00:08:03,240 --> 00:08:04,950
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Hurry up.</b></font>

91
00:08:07,240 --> 00:08:10,450
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Fuushin possesses a Kekkei Genkai…</b></font>

92
00:08:10,530 --> 00:08:13,990
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>I believe he originally was a member
of En Oyashiro's guard unit.</b></font>

93
00:08:13,990 --> 00:08:15,950
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>En Oyashiro?</b></font>

94
00:08:16,030 --> 00:08:18,660
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>He's not affiliated with any group.</b></font>

95
00:08:19,620 --> 00:08:24,120
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Even though he's a shinobi,
he's an arms trader.</b></font>

96
00:08:24,120 --> 00:08:28,070
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>He'll sell weapons to anyone
for the right price,</b></font>

97
00:08:28,160 --> 00:08:31,200
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>so he's known as
the "Merchant of Death."</b></font>

98
00:08:31,660 --> 00:08:35,370
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>He's amassed a huge fortune
during his lifetime.</b></font>

99
00:08:36,200 --> 00:08:37,530
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Where is he?</b></font>

100
00:08:37,620 --> 00:08:39,070
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Who knows…</b></font>

101
00:08:39,410 --> 00:08:43,030
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>He has a hideout
even better hidden than mine.</b></font>

102
00:08:43,240 --> 00:08:46,990
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>I think finding him
will be very difficult.</b></font>

103
00:08:47,530 --> 00:08:52,030
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>For you, even the difficult is easy.</b></font>

104
00:08:54,620 --> 00:08:56,990
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Does that mean you trust me?</b></font>

105
00:08:57,990 --> 00:09:04,070
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Well, I don't know where to find him,
but I can lure him out.</b></font>

106
00:09:05,070 --> 00:09:09,820
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>However…
that may cause a few problems.</b></font>

107
00:09:10,120 --> 00:09:12,990
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Why do you think I came here?</b></font>

108
00:09:13,910 --> 00:09:16,370
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>How unlike you…</b></font>

109
00:09:16,620 --> 00:09:19,570
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>I'm just doing what I have to.</b></font>

110
00:09:21,870 --> 00:09:23,990
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>I sense the wind.</b></font>

111
00:09:24,370 --> 00:09:28,820
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Wait here.
It will take some time to prepare.</b></font>

112
00:09:34,620 --> 00:09:36,070
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Sasuke dear!</b></font>

113
00:09:36,160 --> 00:09:39,070
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>I didn't know that
you knew Orochimaru.</b></font>

114
00:09:39,160 --> 00:09:41,030
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>I don't recall ever telling you.</b></font>

115
00:09:44,820 --> 00:09:46,030
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Sasuke!</b></font>

116
00:09:46,910 --> 00:09:50,530
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Hey! Why didn't you
let me know you're coming?</b></font>

117
00:09:52,200 --> 00:09:53,660
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Sasuke dear…</b></font>

118
00:09:54,280 --> 00:09:56,240
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>"Sasuke dear"?!</b></font>

119
00:09:57,320 --> 00:10:01,240
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>What? Is she your girlfriend, Sasuke?</b></font>

120
00:10:02,410 --> 00:10:06,990
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>You mean, that ugly hag?</b></font>

121
00:10:07,450 --> 00:10:10,410
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Hey! Who're you calling ugly?!</b></font>

122
00:10:10,820 --> 00:10:13,320
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Sasuke, say it's not true!</b></font>

123
00:10:13,410 --> 00:10:14,530
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>It's not true.</b></font>

124
00:10:18,740 --> 00:10:21,990
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>You should've seen
the look of panic on your face.</b></font>

125
00:10:21,990 --> 00:10:23,070
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Shut up!</b></font>

126
00:10:23,160 --> 00:10:26,120
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>If it weren't for that
big mouth of yours!</b></font>

127
00:10:26,200 --> 00:10:28,660
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>That's no excuse for looking like…</b></font>

128
00:10:28,740 --> 00:10:30,120
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>- It's been awhile.
- it's the end of the world!</b></font>

129
00:10:31,200 --> 00:10:33,450
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>You've been continuing your travels?</b></font>

130
00:10:34,620 --> 00:10:35,950
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Yeah.</b></font>

131
00:10:37,030 --> 00:10:39,070
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>You haven't gone back to
Hidden Leaf Village?</b></font>

132
00:10:39,160 --> 00:10:42,410
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>See, you're worried sick
about Sasuke.</b></font>

133
00:10:42,990 --> 00:10:45,570
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>You're really getting on my nerves!</b></font>

134
00:10:46,870 --> 00:10:49,120
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Quiet, you guys.</b></font>

135
00:10:50,120 --> 00:10:52,990
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>I'm ready. Shall we go?</b></font>

136
00:10:53,620 --> 00:10:56,910
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Lord Orochimaru, are you going out?</b></font>

137
00:10:57,370 --> 00:11:00,070
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Sasuke and I are going to the sea.</b></font>

138
00:11:00,320 --> 00:11:01,820
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Huh?!</b></font>

139
00:11:01,910 --> 00:11:03,740
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>The ocean? With Sasuke?</b></font>

140
00:11:04,280 --> 00:11:06,700
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>You all will stay and mind the fort.</b></font>

141
00:11:07,490 --> 00:11:11,570
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>The sea with Lord Orochimaru?
I can't quite picture it.</b></font>

142
00:11:12,070 --> 00:11:14,240
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Wait, that's news to me too.</b></font>

143
00:11:14,370 --> 00:11:17,820
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>To be more precise,
a solitary island in the sea.</b></font>

144
00:11:18,160 --> 00:11:21,410
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>There's a paradise for the wealthy there.</b></font>

145
00:11:22,780 --> 00:11:24,950
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>And that's where En Oyashiro is?</b></font>

146
00:11:25,160 --> 00:11:27,370
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>If he takes the bait.</b></font>

147
00:11:31,570 --> 00:11:33,620
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>- Nowaki.
- Yeah.</b></font>

148
00:11:33,740 --> 00:11:35,950
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Sasuke…</b></font>

149
00:11:37,030 --> 00:11:38,780
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Bleh!</b></font>

150
00:11:40,160 --> 00:11:43,120
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>What's with that girl?
Wanna fight?</b></font>

151
00:11:43,200 --> 00:11:45,370
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Oh, what a drag.</b></font>

152
00:11:51,660 --> 00:11:54,660
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Sasuke working for
the sake of strangers…</b></font>

153
00:11:55,910 --> 00:12:00,700
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>The Hidden Leaf was attacked…
They're not strangers…</b></font>

154
00:12:01,070 --> 00:12:04,320
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>But he didn't return to the village.</b></font>

155
00:12:04,410 --> 00:12:06,320
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>I wonder if it's hard
for him to go back?</b></font>

156
00:12:06,530 --> 00:12:08,450
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Don't you guys get it?</b></font>

157
00:12:09,740 --> 00:12:12,160
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>The big war might be over,</b></font>

158
00:12:12,240 --> 00:12:15,030
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>but there are still lots of
dangerous characters lurking around.</b></font>

159
00:12:15,120 --> 00:12:17,870
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>As long as Sasuke has those eyes…</b></font>

160
00:12:17,950 --> 00:12:20,450
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>shinobi will continue
to attack the village.</b></font>

161
00:12:20,870 --> 00:12:24,240
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>So by showing that Sasuke Uchiha
isn't in Hidden Leaf Village</b></font>

162
00:12:24,320 --> 00:12:27,530
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>and he's still journeying
around the world,</b></font>

163
00:12:27,620 --> 00:12:30,820
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>it lessens the possibility that
the village will be harmed.</b></font>

164
00:12:31,620 --> 00:12:35,200
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>So then,
Sasuke has to continue traveling?</b></font>

165
00:12:36,990 --> 00:12:39,120
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>That might be it.</b></font>

166
00:12:51,370 --> 00:12:52,620
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Still…</b></font>

167
00:12:52,700 --> 00:12:56,410
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>The fact that you, the one who instigated
the destruction of the Hidden Leaf,</b></font>

168
00:12:56,490 --> 00:13:00,120
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>the assassination of the Fourth Kazekage
and countless other horrific crimes,</b></font>

169
00:13:00,200 --> 00:13:04,620
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>can still move around freely
is quite astonishing.</b></font>

170
00:13:07,570 --> 00:13:09,280
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>I'm not free.</b></font>

171
00:13:10,530 --> 00:13:13,870
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>And who are you to talk, Sasuke?</b></font>

172
00:13:14,320 --> 00:13:18,780
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>By all rights, you should be locked up.</b></font>

173
00:13:19,030 --> 00:13:21,530
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>But even Kabuto,</b></font>

174
00:13:21,620 --> 00:13:25,030
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>one of the war criminals from
the Fourth Ninja World War</b></font>

175
00:13:25,120 --> 00:13:27,870
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>is now the director of an orphanage…</b></font>

176
00:13:28,280 --> 00:13:29,700
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Kabuto is?</b></font>

177
00:13:29,990 --> 00:13:32,200
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Of course, compared to me,</b></font>

178
00:13:32,280 --> 00:13:36,870
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>the likelihood that Kabuto will
resort to evil is lower.</b></font>

179
00:13:37,160 --> 00:13:39,240
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>How can you be so sure?</b></font>

180
00:13:41,320 --> 00:13:45,070
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Don't you trust the power
of Itachi Uchiha?</b></font>

181
00:13:47,160 --> 00:13:51,070
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>You and I, and Kabuto
could just be insurance…</b></font>

182
00:13:51,160 --> 00:13:55,490
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>in case something happens that cannot
be countered with common sense.</b></font>

183
00:13:55,910 --> 00:13:57,120
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Insurance?</b></font>

184
00:13:57,410 --> 00:14:00,410
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>In every era, a maverick appears.</b></font>

185
00:14:01,070 --> 00:14:04,660
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>When that happens, there may be
a need for people like us</b></font>

186
00:14:04,740 --> 00:14:07,320
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>who possess powers
considered to be inhuman.</b></font>

187
00:14:07,450 --> 00:14:10,740
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>There are things that cannot be
protected by righteousness alone.</b></font>

188
00:14:11,700 --> 00:14:16,950
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>If that's the case, keeping us around
like pets might be mutually beneficial.</b></font>

189
00:14:18,030 --> 00:14:19,740
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>But…</b></font>

190
00:14:19,820 --> 00:14:25,530
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>your friend would never even
think of such a tactic.</b></font>

191
00:14:27,820 --> 00:14:29,410
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Probably not.</b></font>

192
00:14:32,570 --> 00:14:35,570
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>There…
You can see it in the distance.</b></font>

193
00:14:52,820 --> 00:14:54,200
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Where are we?</b></font>

194
00:14:54,280 --> 00:14:57,950
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>This is an island that
you can't find on any map.</b></font>

195
00:14:58,160 --> 00:14:59,410
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Oh…</b></font>

196
00:14:59,700 --> 00:15:01,280
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Let's go.</b></font>

197
00:15:19,240 --> 00:15:21,280
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>What is this place?</b></font>

198
00:15:21,620 --> 00:15:23,990
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>It's called the Coliseum.</b></font>

199
00:15:24,160 --> 00:15:25,870
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Coliseum?</b></font>

200
00:15:30,200 --> 00:15:34,660
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Is everyone enjoying themselves so far?</b></font>

201
00:15:36,120 --> 00:15:39,030
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Honors to the victor!
Despair to the vanquished!</b></font>

202
00:15:39,450 --> 00:15:41,030
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>As you know, the rules are simple!</b></font>

203
00:15:41,030 --> 00:15:45,030
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>The one with your ID tag goes up against
one with another person's ID tag.</b></font>

204
00:15:45,240 --> 00:15:49,120
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>And the winner is whoever manages
to take his opponent's ID tag…</b></font>

205
00:15:49,200 --> 00:15:53,030
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Simply put, it's a survival match!</b></font>

206
00:15:54,820 --> 00:15:57,030
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>What's going on, Orochimaru?</b></font>

207
00:15:57,530 --> 00:15:59,620
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>You heard the explanation.</b></font>

208
00:15:59,910 --> 00:16:04,490
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>The wealthy patrons here pit their shinobi
against shinobi employed by others.</b></font>

209
00:16:04,570 --> 00:16:08,570
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>The losing shinobi becomes theirs.</b></font>

210
00:16:09,780 --> 00:16:12,620
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>And now, today's semi-final match!</b></font>

211
00:16:13,820 --> 00:16:15,530
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Now entering the ring…</b></font>

212
00:16:15,620 --> 00:16:19,620
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Wearing the ID tag of President Makibi
of the Makibi Corporation…</b></font>

213
00:16:20,030 --> 00:16:23,240
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Raimei, the Black Lightning Flash!</b></font>

214
00:16:25,280 --> 00:16:26,990
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>His opponent…</b></font>

215
00:16:27,070 --> 00:16:30,910
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Wearing the ID tag of President Himeyuri
of the Himeyuri Company…</b></font>

216
00:16:30,990 --> 00:16:34,200
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Suzuran, the Eerie Flame
of the White Moon!</b></font>

217
00:16:35,570 --> 00:16:38,240
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>This place is like a casino.</b></font>

218
00:16:40,950 --> 00:16:43,070
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>All right, let's begin!</b></font>

219
00:16:43,160 --> 00:16:45,950
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>It's now or never, no foul play,
no grudges afterwards…</b></font>

220
00:16:46,030 --> 00:16:47,700
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>A single-bout challenge!</b></font>

221
00:16:48,120 --> 00:16:49,240
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Ready?</b></font>

222
00:16:49,450 --> 00:16:51,070
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Fight!</b></font>

223
00:17:05,990 --> 00:17:09,030
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>I don't have time to waste
on sick hobbies.</b></font>

224
00:17:09,370 --> 00:17:11,280
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Where is En Oyashiro?</b></font>

225
00:17:11,370 --> 00:17:12,990
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>I wonder…</b></font>

226
00:17:13,450 --> 00:17:18,700
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>But this is about the only place
that he'll show up.</b></font>

227
00:17:19,030 --> 00:17:22,070
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Although, he won't come
if there's no shinobi he wants.</b></font>

228
00:17:23,700 --> 00:17:26,450
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Whoa! Suzuran is down!</b></font>

229
00:17:27,070 --> 00:17:30,120
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>The winner is Raimei!</b></font>

230
00:17:30,780 --> 00:17:33,820
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>President Makibi is overjoyed!</b></font>

231
00:17:35,240 --> 00:17:37,450
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>You're useless!</b></font>

232
00:17:37,530 --> 00:17:41,780
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Why do you think
I kept you all this time?!</b></font>

233
00:17:42,120 --> 00:17:44,410
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>You ingrate…</b></font>

234
00:17:45,410 --> 00:17:47,280
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>This place is worthless.</b></font>

235
00:17:47,410 --> 00:17:49,570
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Then why don't you help?</b></font>

236
00:17:51,070 --> 00:17:55,030
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>To a victim, the assailant and
a third party are no different.</b></font>

237
00:17:56,070 --> 00:18:01,030
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>People are no better than the assailant
if they didn't try to help.</b></font>

238
00:18:02,200 --> 00:18:09,030
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>If you only pity the loser and do nothing
to stop the decadence of the rich…</b></font>

239
00:18:09,030 --> 00:18:12,410
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>you're just as guilty, Sasuke.</b></font>

240
00:18:12,990 --> 00:18:14,870
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Chino, stop.</b></font>

241
00:18:18,160 --> 00:18:19,200
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Chino!</b></font>

242
00:18:22,030 --> 00:18:26,280
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Was this sight too shocking
for a child?</b></font>

243
00:18:26,620 --> 00:18:28,990
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>No, she's older than me.</b></font>

244
00:18:30,320 --> 00:18:31,200
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>What?</b></font>

245
00:18:32,070 --> 00:18:34,070
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>The wait is finally over!</b></font>

246
00:18:34,160 --> 00:18:36,120
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Now, for the main event!</b></font>

247
00:18:36,200 --> 00:18:41,200
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Wearing En Oyashiro's ID tag is Futsu!</b></font>

248
00:18:42,450 --> 00:18:45,160
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>It seems he took the bait.</b></font>

249
00:18:45,990 --> 00:18:50,240
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>And his opponent will be wearing
Lord Orochimaru's ID tag…</b></font>

250
00:18:50,320 --> 00:18:54,570
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>The legendary shinobi who attacked
the Five Kage Conference…</b></font>

251
00:18:54,660 --> 00:18:59,030
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>The last Uchiha…
Sasuke Uchiha!</b></font>

252
00:19:04,820 --> 00:19:06,660
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>What is the meaning of this?!</b></font>

253
00:19:06,740 --> 00:19:11,450
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>I told you. Oyashiro will only
appear for something he wants.</b></font>

254
00:19:13,070 --> 00:19:16,490
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>He is…a collector of Kekkei Genkai.</b></font>

255
00:19:16,660 --> 00:19:19,120
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>A collector of Kekkei Genkai?</b></font>

256
00:19:19,200 --> 00:19:20,280
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Yes…</b></font>

257
00:19:20,370 --> 00:19:22,660
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>As for you with
your Sharingan, Sasuke…</b></font>

258
00:19:22,740 --> 00:19:26,240
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>He probably wants you so bad,
he can taste it.</b></font>

259
00:19:26,740 --> 00:19:31,280
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Couldn't he have just searched
for me if he knew I was here?</b></font>

260
00:19:31,570 --> 00:19:34,200
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Oyashiro is a careful man.</b></font>

261
00:19:34,280 --> 00:19:39,070
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>He can easily camouflage his scent,
let alone his appearance and form.</b></font>

262
00:19:39,200 --> 00:19:41,370
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Who knows where he is?</b></font>

263
00:19:41,780 --> 00:19:47,450
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>However, he will definitely appear
after the match for the ID tag transfer.</b></font>

264
00:19:47,530 --> 00:19:49,990
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>That's the custom here.</b></font>

265
00:19:51,780 --> 00:19:55,700
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Wait a minute,
could this be a default?</b></font>

266
00:19:56,200 --> 00:19:57,490
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Now go…</b></font>

267
00:19:59,160 --> 00:20:02,240
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>He's here! He arrives, ready to go!</b></font>

268
00:20:02,320 --> 00:20:05,280
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Sasuke Uchiha has appeared!</b></font>

269
00:20:06,530 --> 00:20:09,030
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>So that's Sasuke Uchiha.</b></font>

270
00:20:10,120 --> 00:20:12,660
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Let me see your Sharingan.</b></font>

271
00:20:13,030 --> 00:20:15,160
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>All right, let us begin!</b></font>

272
00:20:15,240 --> 00:20:18,780
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>It's now or never, no foul play,
no grudges afterwards…</b></font>

273
00:20:18,870 --> 00:20:20,120
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>A single-bout challenge!</b></font>

274
00:20:20,280 --> 00:20:21,870
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Ready…</b></font>

275
00:20:21,950 --> 00:20:23,370
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Fight!</b></font>

276
00:20:40,200 --> 00:20:42,700
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Vapor Style: Solid Fog Jutsu, eh?</b></font>

277
00:20:51,030 --> 00:20:53,030
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>P-President Makibi?</b></font>

278
00:20:53,740 --> 00:20:54,870
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Is he all right?!</b></font>

279
00:20:54,950 --> 00:20:57,030
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>A-Ambulance!
Call an ambulance!</b></font>

280
00:21:06,200 --> 00:21:08,030
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>An Exploding Human?</i></b></font>

281
00:22:40,280 --> 00:22:42,070
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>The Chi no Ike Clan?

</b></font>

282
00:22:42,160 --> 00:22:45,820
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Seems the Uchiha Clan who
suffered long through persecution

</b></font>

283
00:22:45,910 --> 00:22:48,990
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>were also complicit in
the persecution of others…

</b></font>

284
00:22:49,070 --> 00:22:50,990
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Did Itachi know about this?

</b></font>

285
00:22:51,070 --> 00:22:54,620
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>You might find something
if you go to Hell Valley.

</b></font>

286
00:22:54,700 --> 00:22:57,070
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>I want to see this Hell Valley
with my own eyes…

</b></font>

287
00:22:57,950 --> 00:23:04,200
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Next time on Naruto Shippuden:
"Sasuke's Story: Sunrise, Part 3:
Fuushin"


</b></font>

288
00:23:04,370 --> 00:23:07,780
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>As the only survivor of
the Uchiha Clan, I'll…


</b></font>

289
00:23:08,820 --> 00:23:28,320
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Tune in again!


</b></font>

